<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5970] tableWithUTFCharacters throws IndexOutOfBoundsException when INSERT/CREATE statement is executed</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5970</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;ref. &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/commit/0fc1d7ba2081ebeed5c45d87c27ca57727f54099&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/commit/0fc1d7ba2081ebeed5c45d87c27ca57727f54099&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The error occurs in &lt;b&gt;parseSQLJsonOutput (line 180)&lt;/b&gt; as it always expects &lt;b&gt;rowsOutput&lt;/b&gt; to have at least 2 values.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;When INSERT/CREATE statement is executed, the &lt;b&gt;rowsOutput&lt;/b&gt; is empty, the app throws &lt;b&gt;IndexOutOfBoundsException&lt;/b&gt;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
